      "created_at": "2016-08-24T21:13:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thank you for your replies.<br>\nI clearly understand now. Only way that lava appears is with Geothermal power thing and (if) Villains won Scenario 2 for 6 lava tokens for free at beginning.</p>\n<p>For skirmish or anything else, I can improvize <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
